Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean I was in there just listening to them bitch about each other
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在里面  听着他们两个人骂来骂去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:39.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and all I kept thinking about was the fourth of July.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:39.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是心里却一直在想着国庆日
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Becasue it reminded you of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.77,0:18:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为那让你想起我们的先辈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}our forefathers used to bitch at each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.25,0:18:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从前也是骂来骂去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just this thing. Every year we would go out on my dad's boat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.84,0:18:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的  我们每年都会坐我爸的船出海
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and watch the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去看烟火
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:54.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom always hated it 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:54.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈总是讨厌去  
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:57.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because the ocean air made her hair all big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:57.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为海风会把她的头发吹膨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:19:00.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My sister Jill would be throwing up over the side
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:19:00.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妹妹吉尔  则会靠在船边呕吐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and my dad would be upset becasue nobody was helping
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸会生气  因为没有人帮他忙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:07.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then when we did help he would scream at us for doing it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:07.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我们帮忙时  他又会大吼说我们越帮越忙
