Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后会变得很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:20.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and we would all just sort of smush under this one blanket.
